  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Your gaze pierces through even the most dangerous threats. When you Seek, your Seek check is also used as a 6th rank counteract check against any illusion, morph or polymorph effect that you can see within 30 feet of you. If your counteract check succeeds against an effect, you know of an effect’s existence and see through it, even though you do not end the effect. Once this attempt is made against an effect, you cannot attempt to see through an effect for another 24 hours.</span></p>"
